     "*   **GVDB Node:** Represents a sparse voxel brick.",
     "At each step, sample the SDF using `tex3D` at the offset position.",
     "*   If `tex3D` value $\\ge$ `SCN_THRESH`, a hit is detected.",
     "*   **Time Complexity:** $O(N \\cdot M)$ where $N$ is the number of pixels and $M$ is the number of coarse steps plus binary search iterations.",
     "The coarse step size `SCN_PSTEP` determines $N$.",
     "Coarse marching may miss very thin features if `SCN_PSTEP` is too large."
    ]
